Though if you think about it, dotted-and-spaceless style is the speech
version of lOjban. The version computers will be using the communicate to
each other over the internet - no point in wasting extra bandwidth on
spaces, when it requires less parsing without them, and gives you the same
result.

the lOjban computers will be using, la'a is going to be quite a bit
different from the current version.

